---
source: src/app/space_weather_warning.rs
expression: "listed.join(\"\\n\\n\")"
---
Aircraft interference: ≥2% of aircraft in a crossed cell reported low navigation accuracy (gpsjam.org's yellow level).
How does aircraft interference data relate to GNSS?

Geomagnetic activity: Kp or Hp30 ≥5 (NOAA G1).
How does geomagnetic activity affect GNSS?

Solar flares: class M1 or stronger (NOAA R1), receiver is on the sunlit side.
How do solar flares affect GNSS?

ΔTEC: >43% above or >30% below the 27-day median (moderate storm on the planetary ionospheric storm index).
How does ionospheric TEC affect GNSS?
